    "result_text": "All 23 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `membershipNumber` field, formatted as `<customerCode>-M<YY>` (last two digits of the registration date year), following the existing conventions used for `customerCode`:\n\n- **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added the `membershipNumber` field (`@Column(name = \"membership_number\")`) with getter/setter.\n- **`OwnerRestControllerV1.java`** \u2014 after `customerCode` and `registrationDate` are assigned during owner creation, it now sets the membership number via a new `generateMembershipNumber(...)` helper that formats `<customerCode>-M<YY>` (year mod 100, zero-padded).\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the read-only `membershipNumber` property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` carries it and MapStruct maps it automatically.\n- **Schema files** (h2, hsqldb, postgres, mysql) \u2014 added the `membership_number` column to the `owners` table for consistency with the other generated columns.\n\nThe new `Cp14Tests` and all pre-existing tests (23 total) are green.",
